{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"高宗","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"高宗天皇大聖大弘孝皇帝諱治，字為善，太宗第九子也。母曰文德皇后長孫氏。始封晉王，貞觀七年，遙領并州都督。十七年，太子承乾廢，而魏王泰次當立，亦以罪黜，乃立子治為皇太子。太宗嘗命皇太子遊觀習射，太子辭以非所好，願得奉至尊，居膝下。太宗大喜，乃營寢殿側為別院，使太子居之。太宗每視朝，皇太子常侍，觀決庶政。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二十三年，太宗有疾，詔皇太子聽政於金液門。四月，從幸翠微宮。太宗崩，以羽檄發六府甲士四千，衛皇太子入于京師。六月甲戌，即皇帝位于柩前。大赦，賜文武官勳一轉，民八十以上粟帛，給復雍州及比歲供軍所一年。癸未，長孫无忌為太尉。癸巳，檢校洛州刺史李勣為開府儀同三司，參掌機密。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月癸酉，河東地震。乙亥，又震。庚辰，遣使存問河東，給復二年，賜壓死者人絹三匹。庚寅，葬文皇帝于昭陵。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月甲寅，荊王元景為司徒，吳王恪為司空。乙卯，李勣為尚書左僕射、同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月乙丑，晉州地震。左翊衛郎將高侃伐突厥。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是冬，無雪。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"永徽元年正月辛丑，改元。丙午，立妃王氏為皇后。張行成為侍中。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月辛卯，封子孝為許王，上金杞王，素節雍王。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月己巳，晉州地震。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月己未，太白晝見。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月，高侃及突厥戰于金山，敗之。庚辰，晉州地震，詔五品以上言事。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月辛酉，以旱慮囚。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月戊辰，給五品以上解官充侍者半祿，加賜帛。庚午，降死罪以下。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月癸卯，高侃俘突厥車鼻可汗以獻。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月戊辰，李勣罷左僕射。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月己未，貶褚遂良為同州刺史。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月庚午，琰州獠寇邊，梓州都督謝萬歲死之。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年正月戊戌，開義倉以賑民。乙巳，黃門侍郎宇文節、中書侍郎柳奭同中書門下三品。乙卯，瑤池都督阿史那賀魯叛。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月乙丑，命有司毋進肉食，訖于五月。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月丁未，賀魯寇庭州，左武衛大將軍梁建方、右驍衛大將軍契苾何力為弓月道行軍總管以伐之。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月己巳，高季輔為侍中；于志寧為尚書左僕射，張行成為右僕射，同中書門下三品。己卯，白水蠻寇邊，左領軍將軍趙孝祖為郎州道行軍總管以伐之。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月癸卯，以同州苦泉牧地賜貧民。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月辛卯，晉州地震。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月辛酉，有事于南郊。癸酉，禁進犬馬鷹鶻。戊寅，忻州地震。甲申，雨木冰。是月，竇州、義州蠻寇邊，桂州都督劉伯英敗之。趙孝祖及白水蠻戰于羅仵候山，敗之。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月乙未，太白晝見。壬子，處月朱邪孤注殺招慰使單道惠，叛附于賀魯。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是冬，無雪。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三年正月癸亥，梁建方及處月戰于牢山，敗之。甲子，以旱避正殿，減膳，降囚罪，徒以下原之。己巳，褚遂良為吏部尚書、同中書門下三品。丙子，享于太廟。丁亥，耕藉田。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月辛巳，雨土。宇文節為侍中，柳奭守中書令。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月庚寅，趙孝祖及白水蠻戰，敗之。甲午，彭王元則薨。是月，兵部侍郎韓瑗為黃門侍郎、同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月庚申，求齊侍中崔季舒、給事黃門侍郎裴澤、隋儀同三司豆盧毓、御史中丞游楚客子孫官之。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月丁巳，立陳王忠為皇太子，大赦，賜五品以上子為父後者勳一轉，民酺三日。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月丙辰，求周司沐大夫裴融、尚書左丞封孝琰子孫官之。是月，中書侍郎來濟同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月癸巳，濮王泰薨。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四年二月甲申，駙馬都尉房遺愛薛萬徹柴令武、高陽巴陵公主謀反，伏誅；殺荊王元景、吳王恪。乙酉，流宇文節于桂州。戊子，廢蜀王愔為庶人。己亥，徐王元禮為司徒，李勣為司空。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月壬寅，以旱慮囚，遣使決天下獄，減殿中、太僕馬粟，詔文武官言事。甲辰，避正殿，減膳。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月己丑，太白晝見。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月己亥，隕石于馮翊十有八。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月壬戌，張行成薨。甲戌，褚遂良為尚書右僕射。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月庚子，幸溫湯。甲辰，赦新豐。乙巳，至自溫湯。戊申，睦州女子陳碩真反，婺州刺史崔義玄討之。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月庚戌，陳碩真伏誅。癸丑，兵部尚書崔敦禮為侍中。丁巳，柳奭為中書令。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月庚子，高季輔薨。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五年正月丙寅，以旱詔文武官、朝集使言事。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月戊午，如萬年宮。乙丑，次鳳泉湯。辛未，赦岐州及所過徒罪以下。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月癸亥，柳奭罷。丙寅，河北大水，遣使慮囚。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月己未，詔免麟游、岐陽今歲課役，岐州及供頓縣半歲。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月丁酉，至自萬年宮。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月癸卯，築京師羅郭，起觀于九門。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六年正月壬申，拜昭陵，赦醴泉及行從，免縣今歲租、調，陵所宿衛進爵一級，令、丞加一階。癸酉，以少牢祭陪葬者。甲戌，至自昭陵。庚寅，封子弘為代王，賢潞王。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月乙巳，皇太子加元服，降死罪以下，賜酺三日，五品以上為父後者勳一轉。乙丑，營州都督程名振、左衛中郎將蘇定方伐高麗。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月壬午，及高麗戰于貴端水，敗之。癸未，左屯衛大將軍程知節為葱山道行軍大總管，以伐賀魯。壬辰，韓瑗為侍中，來濟為中書令。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月乙酉，崔敦禮為中書令。是月，中書舍人李義府為中書侍郎，參知政事。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月庚午，貶褚遂良為潭州都督。乙酉，洛水溢。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月，齊州黃河溢。己酉，廢皇后為庶人。乙卯，立宸妃武氏為皇后。丁巳，大赦，賜民八十以上粟帛。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月己巳，皇后見于太廟。戊子，停諸州貢珠。癸巳，詔禁吏酷法及為隱名書者。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是冬，皇后殺王庶人。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"顯慶元年正月辛未，廢皇太子為梁王，立代王弘為皇太子。壬申，大赦，改元，賜五品以上子為父後者勳一轉，民酺三日，八十以上粟帛。丙戌，禁胡人為幻戲者。甲午，放宮人。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月辛巳，皇后親蠶。丙戌，戶部侍郎杜正倫為黃門侍郎、同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月壬寅，詔五品以上老疾不以罪者同致仕。壬子，矩州人謝無零反，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月癸未，崔敦禮為太子少師、同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月丙申，崔敦禮薨。辛丑，程知節及賀魯部歌邏祿、處月戰于榆慕谷，敗之。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月庚辰，括州海溢。癸未，程知節及賀魯戰于怛篤城，敗之。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月乙丑，以子顯生，賜京官、朝集使勳一轉。自八月霜且雨至於是月。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是歲，龜茲大將羯獵顛附于賀魯，左屯衛大將軍楊冑伐之。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年閏正月壬寅，如洛陽宮。庚戌，右屯衛將軍蘇定方為伊麗道行軍總管，以伐賀魯。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月癸亥，降洛州囚罪，徒以下原之，免民一歲租、調，賜百歲以上氊衾粟帛。庚午，封子顯為周王。壬申，徙封素節為郇王。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月戊申，禁舅姑拜公主，父母拜王妃。癸丑，李義府兼中書令。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月丙申，幸明德宮。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月丁亥，如洛陽宮。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月丁卯，貶韓瑗為振州刺史，來濟為台州刺史。辛未，衛尉卿許敬宗為侍中。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月庚寅，杜正倫兼中書令。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月戊戌，如許州。甲辰，遣使慮所過州縣囚。乙巳，獵于滍南。壬子，講武于新鄭，赦鄭州，免一歲租賦，賜八十以上粟帛，其嘗事高祖任佐史者以名聞。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月乙卯，如洛陽宮。丁巳，蘇定方敗賀魯于金牙山，執之。丁卯，以洛陽宮為東都。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三年正月戊申，楊冑及龜茲羯獵顛戰于泥師城，敗之。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月甲狾，至自東都。戊寅，慮囚。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月壬子，程名振及高麗戰于赤烽鎮，敗之。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月乙酉，貶杜正倫為橫州刺史，李義府普州刺史。戊子，許敬宗權檢校中書令。甲午，蘇定方俘賀魯以獻。戊戌，許敬宗為中書令，大理卿辛茂將兼侍中。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四年三月壬午，崑陵都護阿史那彌射及西突厥真珠葉護戰于雙河，敗之。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月丙辰，于志寧為太子太師、同中書門下三品。乙丑，黃門侍郎許圉師同中書門下三品。戊辰，流長孫无忌于黔州。于志寧罷。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月己卯，許圉師為中書侍郎、同中書門下三品。丙申，兵部尚書任雅相、度支尚書盧承慶參知政事。戊戌，殺涼州都督長史趙持滿。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月己丑，以旱避正殿。壬辰，慮囚。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月壬子，李義府為吏部尚書、同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月丙午，皇太子加元服，大赦，賜五品以上子孫為父祖後者勳一轉，民酺三日。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"閏月戊寅，如東都，皇太子監國。辛巳，詔所過供頓免今歲租賦之半，賜民八十以上氊衾粟帛。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月丙午，許圉師為左散騎常侍、檢校侍中。戊午，辛茂將薨。癸亥，賀魯部悉結闕俟斤都曼寇邊，左驍衛大將軍蘇定方為安撫大使以伐之。盧承慶同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五年正月癸卯，蘇定方俘都曼以獻。甲子，如并州。己巳，次長平，賜父老布帛。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月丙戌，赦并州及所過州縣，義旗初嘗任五品以上葬并州者祭之，加佐命功臣食別封者子孫二階，大將軍府僚佐存者一階，民年八十以上版授刺史、縣令，賜酺三日。甲午，祠舊宅。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月丙午，皇后宴親族鄰里于朝堂，會命婦于內殿。賜從官五品以上、并州長史司馬勳一轉。婦人八十以上版授郡君，賜氊衾粟帛。己酉，講武于城西。辛亥，左武衛大將軍蘇定方為神兵道行軍大總管，新羅王金春秋為嵎夷道行軍總管，率三將軍及新羅兵以伐百濟。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月癸巳，如東都。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月辛丑，作八關宮。戊辰，定襄都督阿史德樞賔為沙磚道行軍總管，以伐契丹。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月庚午朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月乙巳，廢梁王忠為庶人。丁卯，盧承慶罷。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月庚辰，蘇定方及百濟戰，敗之。壬午，左武衛大將軍鄭仁泰及悉結、拔也固、僕骨、同羅戰，敗之。癸未，赦神兵道大總管以下軍士及其家，賜民酺三日。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月戊戌，蘇定方俘百濟王以獻。甲寅，如許州。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月辛未，獵于安樂川。己卯，如東都。壬午，左驍衛大將軍契苾何力為浿江道行軍大總管，蘇定方為遼東道行軍大總管，左驍衛將軍劉伯英為平壤道行軍大總管，以伐高麗。阿史德樞賔及奚、契丹戰，敗之。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"龍朔元年正月戊午，鴻臚卿蕭嗣業為扶餘道行軍總管，以伐高麗。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月乙未，改元，赦洛州。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月庚辰，任雅相為浿江道行軍總管，契苾何力為遼東道行軍總管，蘇定方為平壤道行軍總管，蕭嗣業為扶餘道行軍總管，右驍衛將軍程名振為鏤方道行軍總管，左驍衛將軍龐孝泰為沃沮道行軍總管，率三十五軍以伐高麗。甲午晦，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月辛巳，太白經天。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月甲戌，蘇定方及高麗戰于浿江，敗之。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月癸卯，及皇后幸李勣、許圉師第。壬子，徙封賢為沛王。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月丁卯，獵于陸渾。戊辰，獵于非山。癸酉，如東都。鄭仁泰為鐵勒道行軍大總管，蕭嗣業為仙崿道行軍大總管，左驍衛大將軍阿史那忠為長岑道行軍大總管，以伐鐵勒。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年二月甲子，大易官名。甲戌，任雅相薨。戊寅，龐孝泰及高麗戰于蛇水，死之。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月庚寅，鄭仁泰及鐵勒戰于天山，敗之。乙巳，如河北縣。辛亥，如蒲州。癸丑，如同州。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月庚申，至自同州。辛巳，作蓬萊宮。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月癸亥，禁宗戚獻纂組雕鏤。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月戊子，以子旭輪生滿月，大赦，賜酺三日。右威衛將軍孫仁師為熊津道行軍總管，以伐百濟。戊戌，李義府罷。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月壬寅，許敬宗為太子少師、同東西臺三品。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月丁丑，李義府起復。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月丁酉，幸溫湯，皇太子監國。丁未，至自溫湯。庚戌，西臺侍郎上官儀同東西臺三品。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月辛未，貶許圉師為虔州刺史。癸酉，封子旭輪為殷王。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是歲，右衛將軍蘇海政為〈風日〉海道行軍總管，以伐龜茲。海政殺崑陵都護阿史那彌射。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三年正月乙丑，李義府為右相。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月，減百官一月俸，賦雍、同等十五州民錢，以作蓬萊宮。乙亥，殺駙馬都尉韋正矩。庚戌，慮囚。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月戊子，流李義府于巂州。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月壬午，柳州蠻叛，冀州都督長史劉伯英以嶺南兵伐之。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月，吐蕃攻吐谷渾，涼州都督鄭仁泰為青海道行軍大總管以救之。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月癸卯，有彗星出于左攝提。戊申，詔百寮言事。遣按察大使于十道。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月戊午，孫仁師及百濟戰于白江，敗之。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月辛巳，詔皇太子五日一至光順門，監諸司奏事，小事決之。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月甲戌，雨木冰。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月庚子，改明年為麟德元年，降京師、雍州諸縣死罪以下。壬寅，安西都護高賢為行軍總管，以伐弓月。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"麟德元年二月戊子，如福昌宮。癸卯，如萬年宮。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月壬午，道王元慶薨。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月戊申，許王孝薨。丙寅，以旱避正殿。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月丁未，詔以三年正月有事于泰山。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月己卯，幸舊第，降萬年縣死罪以下。壬午，至自萬年宮。丁亥，司列太常伯劉祥道兼右相，大司憲竇德玄為司元太常伯、檢校左相。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月丙戌，殺上官儀。戊子，殺庶人忠。劉祥道罷。太子右中護樂彥瑋、西臺侍郎孫處約同知軍國政事。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是冬，無雪。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年二月壬午，如東都。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月甲寅，司戎太常伯姜恪同東西臺三品。戊午，遣使慮京都諸司及雍、洛二州囚。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"閏月癸酉，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是春，疏勒、弓月、吐蕃攻于闐，西州都督崔智辯、左武衛將軍曹繼叔救之。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月丙午，赦桂、廣、黔三都督府。丙寅，講武于邙山之陽。戊辰，左侍極陸敦信檢校右相，孫處約、樂彥瑋罷。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月己丑，鄧王元裕薨。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月壬戌，帶方州刺史劉仁軌為大司憲兼知政事。丁卯，如泰山。大有年。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"乾封元年正月戊辰，封于泰山。庚午，禪于社首，以皇后為亞獻。壬申，大赦，改元。賜文武官階、勳、爵。民年八十以上版授下州刺史、司馬、縣令，婦人郡、縣君；七十以上至八十，賜古爵一級。民酺七日，女子百戶牛酒。免所過今年租賦，給復齊州一年半、兗州二年。辛卯，幸曲阜，祠孔子，贈太師。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月己未，如亳州，祠老子，追號太上玄元皇帝，縣人宗姓給復一年。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月甲辰，至自亳州。庚戌，陸敦信罷。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月壬寅，高麗泉男生請內附，右驍衛大將軍契苾何力為遼東安撫大使，率兵援之。左金吾衛將軍龐同善、營州都督高侃為遼東道行軍總管，左武衛將軍薛仁貴、左監門衛將軍李謹行為後援。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月乙丑，徙封旭輪為豫王。庚午，劉仁軌兼右相。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月辛丑，竇德玄薨。丁未，殺始州刺史武惟良、淄州刺史武懷運。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月，龐同善及高麗戰，敗之。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月己酉，李勣為遼東道行臺大總管，率六總管兵以伐高麗。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年正月丁丑，以旱避正殿，減膳，慮囚。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月丁酉，涪陵郡王愔薨。辛丑，禁工商乘馬。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月乙卯，西臺侍郎楊武戴至德、東臺侍郎李安期、司列少常伯趙仁本同東西臺三品。東臺舍人張文瓘參知政事。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月己卯，以旱避正殿，減膳，遣使慮囚。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月己丑朔，日有食之。辛亥，李安期罷。","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月庚申，以餌藥，皇太子監國。辛未，李勣及高麗戰于新城，敗之。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是歲，嶺南洞獠陷瓊州。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"總章元年正月壬子，劉仁軌為遼東道副大總管兼安撫大使、浿江道行軍總管。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月丁巳，皇太子釋奠于國學。戊寅，如九成宮。壬午，李勣敗高麗，克扶餘、南蘇、木底、蒼巖城。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月庚寅，大赦，改元。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月乙卯，贈顏回太子少師，曾參太子少保。丙辰，有彗星出于五車，避正殿，減膳，撤樂，詔內外官言事。庚申，以太原元從西府功臣為二等：第一功後官無五品者，授其子若孫一人，有至四品五品者加二階，有三品以上加爵三等；第二功後官無五品者，授其子若孫從六品一人，有至五品者加一階，六品者二階，三品以上爵一等。辛巳，楊武薨。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月癸酉，至自九成宮。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月癸巳，李勣敗高麗王高藏，執之。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月丁巳，俘高藏以獻。丁卯，有事于南郊。甲戌，姜恪檢校左相，司平太常伯閻立本守右相。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年二月辛酉，右肅機李敬玄為西臺侍郎，張文瓘為東臺侍郎：同東西臺三品。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月丙戌，東臺侍郎郝處俊同東西臺三品。癸巳，皇后親蠶。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月己酉，如九成宮。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月戊申朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月癸巳，左衛大將軍契苾何力為烏海道行軍大總管，以援吐谷渾。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月庚寅，括州海溢。壬寅，如岐州。乙巳，赦岐州，賜高年粟帛。十月丁巳，至自岐州。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月丁亥，徙封旭輪為冀王，改名輪。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月戊申，李勣薨。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是冬，無雪。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"咸亨元年正月丁丑，劉仁軌罷。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月戊申，慮囚。丁巳，東南有聲若雷。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月甲戌，大赦，改元。壬辰，許敬宗罷。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月癸卯，吐蕃陷龜茲撥換城。廢安西四鎮。己酉，李敬玄罷。辛亥，右威衛大將軍薛仁貴為邏娑道行軍大總管，以伐吐蕃。庚午，如九成宮。雍州大雨雹。高麗酋長鉗牟岑叛，寇邊，左監門衛大將軍高侃為東州道行軍總管，右領軍衛大將軍李謹行為燕山道行軍總管，以伐之。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月壬寅朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月甲戌，以雍、華、蒲、同四州旱，遣使慮囚，減中御諸廄馬。戊子，李敬玄起復。薛仁貴及吐蕃戰于大非川，敗績。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月庚戌，以穀貴禁酒。丁巳，至自九成宮。甲子，趙王福薨。丙寅，以旱避正殿，減膳。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月丁丑，給復雍、華、同、岐、邠、隴六州一年。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"閏月癸卯，皇后以旱請避位。甲寅，姜恪為涼州道行軍大總管，以伐吐蕃。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月庚辰，詔文武官言事。乙未，趙仁本罷。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月庚寅，復官名。","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是歲，大饑。","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年正月乙巳，如東都，皇太子監國。","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月辛未，遣使存問諸州。","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月戊子，大風，雨雹。","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月癸巳，以旱慮囚。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月，地震。丙申，徐王元禮薨。","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月丙子，求明禮樂之士。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月甲午朔，日有食之。庚戌，如許州，遣使存問所過疾老鰥寡，慮囚。","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月癸酉，獵于昆陽。丙戌，如東都。是歲，姜恪為侍中，閻立本為中書令。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三年正月辛丑，姚州蠻寇邊，太子右衛副率梁積壽為姚州道行軍總管以伐之。","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月己卯，姜恪薨。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月壬申，校旗于洛水之陰。","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月癸卯，徙封賢為雍王。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月己未，皇太子監國。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月戊子朔，日有食之。甲辰，至自東都。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月，金紫光祿大夫致仕劉仁軌為太子左庶子、同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四年正月丙辰，鄭王元懿薨。","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月丙子，如九成宮。","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"閏五月丁卯，禁作簺捕魚、營圈取獸者。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月辛丑，以不豫詔皇太子聽諸司啟事。己酉，大風落太廟鴟尾。","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月壬午，閻立本薨。乙未，以皇太子納妃，赦岐州，賜酺三日。乙巳，至自九成宮。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"上元元年二月壬午，劉仁軌為雞林道行軍大總管，以伐新羅。","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月辛亥朔，日有食之。己巳，皇后親蠶。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月壬辰，皇帝稱天皇，皇后稱天后。追尊六代祖宣簡公為宣皇帝，妣張氏曰宣莊皇后；五代祖懿王為光皇帝，妣賈氏曰光懿皇后。增高祖、太宗及后謚。大赦，改元，賜酺三日。","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月丙午，如東都。己酉，獵于華山曲武原。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月癸未，蔣王惲自殺。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年正月己未，給復雍、同、華、岐、隴五州一年。辛未，吐蕃請和。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月，劉仁軌及新羅戰于七重城，敗之。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月丁巳，天后親蠶。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月辛巳，天后殺周王顯妃趙氏。丙戌，以旱避正殿，減膳，撤樂，詔百官言事。己亥，天后殺皇太子。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月戊申，追號皇太子為孝敬皇帝。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月戊寅，立雍王賢為皇太子，大赦。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月辛亥，杞王上金免官，削封邑。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月庚寅，葬孝敬皇帝于恭陵。丁酉，詔婦人為宮官者歲一見其親。庚子，張文瓘為侍中，郝處俊為中書令，劉仁軌為尚書左僕射，戴至德為右僕射。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月庚辰，雍州雨雹。壬午，有彗星出于角、亢。","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"儀鳳元年正月壬戌，徙封輪為相王。丁卯，納州獠寇邊。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月丁亥，如汝州溫湯，遣使慮免汝州輕繫。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月癸卯，黃門侍郎來恒、中書侍郎薛元超同中書門下三品。甲辰，如東都，免汝州今歲半租，賜民八十以上帛。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"閏月己巳，吐蕃寇鄯、廓、河、芳四州，左監門衛中郎將令狐智通伐之。乙酉，周王顯為洮河道行軍元帥，領左衛大將軍劉審禮等十二總管，相王輪為涼州道行軍元帥，領契苾何力等軍，以伐吐蕃。","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月戊甲，至自東都。甲寅，中書侍郎李義琰同中書門下三品。戊午，如九成宮。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月癸亥，黃門侍郎高智周同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月丁亥，有彗星出于東井。乙未，吐蕃寇疊州。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月庚子，避正殿，減膳，撤樂，損食粟馬，慮囚，詔文武官言事。甲子，停南北中尚、梨園、作坊，減少府雜匠。是月，青州海溢。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月乙未，至自九成宮。丙午，降封郇王素節鄱陽郡王。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月壬申，大赦，改元。庚寅，李敬玄為中書令。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月戊午，來恒、薛元超為河南、河北道大使。","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二年正月乙亥，耕藉田。庚辰，京師地震。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月，太子左庶子張大安同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月，吐蕃寇扶州。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月辛亥，劉仁軌為洮河軍鎮守使。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月壬辰，徙封顯為英王，更名哲。","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月乙卯，募關內、河東猛士，以伐吐蕃。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"是歲，西突厥及吐蕃寇安西。冬，無雪。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三年正月丙子，李敬玄為洮河道行軍大總管，以伐吐蕃。癸未，遣使募河南、河北猛士，以伐吐蕃。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月丁亥，以旱避正殿，慮囚。戊申，大赦，改明年為通乾元年。癸丑，涇州民生子異體連心。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月壬戌，如九成宮。大雨霖。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月辛酉，至自九成宮。癸亥，張文瓘薨。丙寅，李敬玄、劉審禮及吐蕃戰于青海，敗績，審禮死之。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月丙申，停劍南、隴右歲貢。丙午，密王元曉薨。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"閏十一月丙申，雨木冰。壬子，來恒薨。","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月癸丑，罷通乾號。","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"調露元年正月戊子，如東都。庚戌，戴至德薨。","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月辛酉，郝處俊為侍中。","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月丙戌，皇太子監國。戊戌，作紫桂宮。","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月辛亥，大赦，改元。吏部侍郎裴行儉伐西突厥。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月壬午，行儉敗西突厥，執其可汗都支。","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月，突厥溫傅、奉職二部寇邊，單于大都護府長史蕭嗣業伐之。","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月戊寅，高智周罷。甲辰，禮部尚書裴行儉為定襄道行軍大總管，以伐突厥。","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"永隆元年二月癸丑，如汝州溫湯。丁巳，如少室山。乙丑，如東都。","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月，裴行儉及突厥戰于黑山，敗之。","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月乙丑，如紫桂宮。戊辰，黃門侍郎裴炎、崔知溫，中書侍郎王德真：同中書門下三品。","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月丁酉，太白經天。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月己卯，吐蕃寇河源。辛巳，李敬玄及吐蕃戰于湟川，敗績。左武衛將軍黑齒常之為河源軍經略大使。丙申，江王元祥薨。突厥寇雲州，都督竇懷哲敗之。","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月丁未，如東都。丁巳，貶李敬玄為衡州刺史。甲子，廢皇太子為庶人。乙丑，立英王哲為皇太子，大赦，改元，賜酺三日。己巳，貶張大安為普州刺史。","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月甲申，王德真罷。","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月壬寅，降封曹王明為零陵郡王。戊辰，至自東都。","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月壬申朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"開耀元年正月乙亥，突厥寇原、慶二州。辛巳，賜京官九品以上酺三日。癸巳，裴行儉為定襄道行軍大總管，以伐突厥。己亥，減殿中、太僕馬，省諸方貢獻，免雍、岐、華、同四州二歲稅，河南、河北一年調。","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月丙午，皇太子釋奠于國學。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月辛卯，郝處俊罷。","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月乙酉，常州人劉龍子謀反，伏誅。丙戌，定襄道副總管曹懷舜及突厥戰于橫水，敗績。己丑，黑齒常之及吐蕃戰于良非川，敗之。","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月壬子，永嘉郡王晫有罪，伏誅。","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月己丑，以太平公主下嫁，赦京師。甲午，劉仁軌罷左僕射。","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"閏月丁未，裴炎為侍中，崔知溫、薛元超守中書令。庚戌，以餌藥，皇太子監國。庚申，裴行儉及突厥戰，敗之。","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月丁卯，以河南、河北大水，遣使賑乏絕，室廬壞者給復一年，溺死者贈物，人三段。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月丙申，有彗星出于天市。壬戌，裴行儉俘突厥溫傅可汗、阿史那伏念以獻。乙丑，改元，赦定襄軍及諸道緣征官吏兵募。","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月丙寅朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月癸卯，徙庶人賢于巴州。","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"永淳元年二月癸未，以孫重照生滿月，大赦，改元，賜酺三日。是月，突厥車薄、咽麵寇邊。","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月戊午，立重照為皇太孫。","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月甲子朔，日有食之。丙寅，如東都，皇太子監國。辛未，裴行儉為金牙道行軍大總管，率三總管兵以伐突厥。安西副都護王方翼及車薄、咽麵戰于熱海，敗之。丁亥，黃門侍郎郭待舉、兵部侍郎岑長倩、祕書員外少監郭正一、吏部侍郎魏玄同與中書門下同承受進止平章事。","sentenceOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月乙卯，洛水溢。","sentenceOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"六月甲子，突厥骨咄祿寇邊，嵐州刺史王德茂死之。是月，大蝗，人相食。","sentenceOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月，作萬泉宮。己亥，作奉天宮。庚申，零陵郡王明自殺。","sentenceOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月，吐蕃寇柘州，驍衛郎將李孝逸伐之。","sentenceOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月甲子，京師地震。丙寅，黃門侍郎劉齊賢同中書門下平章事。","sentenceOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"弘道元年正月甲午，幸奉天宮。","sentenceOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"二月庚午，突厥寇定州，刺史霍王元軌敗之。","sentenceOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"三月庚寅，突厥寇單于都護府，司馬張行師死之。庚子，李義琰罷。丙午，有彗星出于五車。癸丑，崔知溫薨。","sentenceOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"四月己未，如東都。壬申，郭待舉、郭正一同中書門下平章事。甲申，綏州部落稽白鐵余寇邊，右武衛將軍程務挺敗之。","sentenceOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_278","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"五月乙巳，突厥寇蔚州，刺史李思儉死之。","sentenceOrder":278},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"七月甲辰，徙封輪為豫王，改名旦。薛元超罷。","sentenceOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_280","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"八月乙丑，皇太子朝于東都，皇太孫留守京師。丁卯，滹沱溢。己巳，河溢，壞河陽城。","sentenceOrder":280},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_281","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"九月己丑，以太平公主子生，赦東都。","sentenceOrder":281},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_282","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十月癸亥，幸奉天宮。","sentenceOrder":282},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_283","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十一月戊戌，右武衛將軍程務挺為單于道安撫大使，以伐突厥。辛丑，皇太子監國。丁未，如東都。戊申，裴炎、劉齊賢、郭正一兼於東宮平章事。","sentenceOrder":283},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_284","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"十二月丁巳，改元，大赦。是夕，皇帝崩于貞觀殿，年五十六。謚曰天皇大帝。天寶八載，改謚天皇大聖皇帝；十三載，增謚天皇大聖大弘孝皇帝。","sentenceOrder":284},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_3_285","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_3","textTraditional":"贊曰：小雅曰：「赫赫宗周，褒姒棕之。」此周幽王之詩也。是時，幽王雖亡，而太子宜臼立，是為平王。而詩人乃言棕之者，以為文、武之業於是蕩盡，東周雖在，不能復興矣。其曰棕者，甚疾之之辭也。武氏之亂，唐之宗室戕殺殆盡，其賢士大夫不免者十八九。以太宗之治，其遺德餘烈在人者未遠，而幾於遂絕，其為惡豈一褒姒之比邪？以太宗之明，昧於知子，廢立之際，不能自決，卒用昏童。高宗溺愛衽席，不戒履霜之漸，而毒流天下，貽禍邦家。嗚呼，父子夫婦之間，可謂難哉！可不慎哉？","sentenceOrder":285}],"overrides":{}}